                <invention-title lang="de">FALTBARER IV-KATHETERBEFESTIGUNGSVERBAND ZUM SCHUTZ VOR UNABSICHTLICHER KONTAMINATION</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PANSEMENT PLIABLE POUR LA FIXATION D'UN CATHÉTER INTRAVEINEUX POUR LA PROTECTION CONTRE LES CONTAMINATIONS ACCIDENTELLES</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">FOLDABLE IV CATHETER SECUREMENT DRESSING FOR PROTECTING AGAINST INADVERTENT CONTAMINATION</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A catheter securement device, comprising:a foldable body, comprising an upper portion and a lower portion, wherein the lower portion of the foldable body includes an adhesive layer on a contact side of the lower portion, wherein the lower portion further comprises an opening to provide a window for placement of a catheter, wherein the upper portion comprises a separation line to divide the upper portion into a first adhesive strip and a second adhesive strip.</p>
            </abstract>
